["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The economics of putting germicidal light in every room, with Misha Gurevich and Vivian Belenky of Aerolamp far UVC krypton chloride excimer lamp ASHRAE 241 R0 hygiene hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-complexsys-222纳米杀菌灯便宜有效-缺的是认知而非技术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fc764da6acb74e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>222纳米灯杀菌有效却一年只卖几百台，瓶颈不是技术</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Far UVC 用 222 纳米光在空气中灭活病原体，对人体表层无害；南非 TB 试验已看到 90% 抑制，但全世界一年只卖几百台。真正瓶颈是认知扩散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">far UVC</span><span class=\"tag\">空气传播疾病</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Julia Ioffe on Russian Women, Missing Men, and the Roots of Autocracy woman question single sex family gender essentialism pronatalist policy steam valve\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-05-tyler-苏联把女人炼成超人-把男人宠成废物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3096d9c0d3a4a23d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">55:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0805</span></div>\n<h2>苏联把女人炼成超人，把男人宠成废物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二战后2700万苏联人丧生，男人成了稀缺资源；国家用堕胎禁令、婚外生育奖励和家暴非刑化把女人锻成超人，把男人宠成废物，这套秩序至今支撑普京的父权动员。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄国社会</span><span class=\"tag\">性别政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E247｜对话盛颖：xAI，Infra的浪漫，SGLang，开源，平权与“甄嬛传” SGLang RadixAttention KVCache Miles day zero one year cliff\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-05-sv101-xai-最美好的时代-为什么留不住她/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0805</span></div>\n<h2>xAI 最美好的时代，为什么留不住她</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">盛颖把 xAI 早期称为 v1.0：不到 100 人、没有 politics、同时给她 support 和 freedom。她为了 SGLang 社区提前两个月离开，放弃一年 cliff 的 vesting。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Infra</span><span class=\"tag\">开源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"美国无人驾驶20年兴衰：天才、小偷、叛徒，从沙漠到法庭的大冒险 DARPA L3 激光雷达 founder mode\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-cnf65bb3-自动驾驶真正的难关不是技术-是最后那-5-的意外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac2c4de6938cb713-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技这碗饭</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>自动驾驶真正的难关不是技术，是最后那 5% 的意外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1995 年一辆奔驰就自动跑完了 1758 公里高速，95% 的里程机器早就会开；可只要剩下 5% 的意外还在，驾驶座上就必须留一个人，司机的工资一分钱都省不下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">DARPA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Big Tech&#x27;s Hidden Debt Problem off-balance-sheet vehicle vendor financing big market delusion incomplete revelation hypothesis limits of arbitrage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-patrickboyle-表外债务不是欺诈-真正的风险是没人读脚注/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">32:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头表外债务不是欺诈，是没人读脚注</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓 1.65 万亿美元隐藏债务并不是 Enron 式欺诈，而是未投运数据中心的长租与采购承诺，合法但埋在脚注里；真正危险的是 AI 巨头靠互相融资和调整后收益讲故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 资本开支</span><span class=\"tag\">表外债务</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What the hell happened with AGI timelines in 2026? – Rob Wiblin RLVR METR ECI GDPval Vending-Bench 2 AI Village\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-eightythousand-agi-时间线提前一年-但脏活仍是瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a7038cb60f3d75b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">49:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>AI 收入年增 700%，但脏活任务仍差人类 6 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年 AI 进展证据：收入爆炸、编码智能体成熟，但脏活任务仍差；时间线缩短约一年，但长期仍存变数。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"283: ENCORE: Best of Ask Lisa: Friendship Breakups &amp; Conflict relational aggression queen bee blame the parent two-faced\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-asklisa-友谊破裂是成长章节-不是人生判决/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>被朋友群踢出不是判决：那是化学键在加固</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子被朋友群排挤，或要主动结束一段友谊，都是青春期的正常章节；家长最该做的是给孩子视角和具体话术，而不是代替他冲进去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">友谊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"178: Ubiquiti least privilege VPN kill switch MAC address\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-darknetdiaries-ubiquiti-内鬼自导自演勒索比特币-败在自家路由器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e2627fbdeaef9327-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">36:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Darknet Diaries</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>年薪 25 万美元仍嫌少，他自导自演勒索自家公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ubiquiti 云团队负责人觉得年薪 25 万美元还不够，自导自演入侵公司、索要 25 比特币，结果被自家路由器记录的 MAC 地址锁定，判刑六年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内鬼攻击</span><span class=\"tag\">企业勒索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Inference Engineering Masterclass — Philip Kiely &amp; Ali Taha, Baseten speculative decoding (spec dec) PD disaggregation NVFP4 mega kernel expert parallelism KV cache compaction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-latentspace-量化更多层反而更准-因为误差会互相抵消/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23103bc773bd5837-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>量化更多层反而更准：误差会互相抵消</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">选对层之后，量化更多反而更保真——误差会互相抵消；同理 10 倍加速不是单点突破，而是量化、speculator、PD 分离各翻一倍叠出来的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理优化</span><span class=\"tag\">量化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Political Economy of Palestine (with Hussein Aboubakr Mansour) autopoietic symbolic convertibility machine UNRWA teshuvah\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-econtalk-巴勒斯坦不是民族事业-而是自再生的政治经济榨取机器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>巴勒斯坦不是民族事业，是台自再生的符号榨取机器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">别再把巴勒斯坦当作单一民族事业——在中东权力结构里，它是一台把苦难转成各方资产的符号机器：没有中心、没有可杀的国王，只能通过个人意义上的清醒破局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东政治</span><span class=\"tag\">寻租经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Tungsten Market Is Warning of an Upcoming War Ammonium Paratungstate (APT) Dry Metric Ton Unit (DMTU) Tungsten Carbide Ionic Absorption Clays\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-oddlots-钨价暴涨背后-一场百年战争预测市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">44:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>钨价暴涨是百年战争预测市场：中国断供即翻十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">钨的供需周期像战争预测市场：战前暴涨、战后崩盘。中国控制八成供应，西方重启旧矿仅需数千万美元，却因缺乏期货市场而难以融资。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">钨</span><span class=\"tag\">关键矿产</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Re-release: Raising an Entrepreneur (Without Taking Over Their Business) Roth IRA unschooling sliding scale pricing guide on the side intake form\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-parentmojo-给孩子最大的财务礼物不是大学基金-是让她10岁创业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>给孩子最大的财务礼物不是大学基金，是让她10岁创业</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">10岁孩子靠宠物托管赚到759美元退休金，这不是提前鸡娃，而是用真实责任练出系统思维、边界感、坚持和财务自由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童创业</span><span class=\"tag\">财务启蒙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"50 - Eli Lifland on AI 2027 research taste uplift time horizon research stock indexical sandbag\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-02-axrp-ai-2027-作者-对齐下一代-ai-ai-比人省一千倍力气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/912f9695220a1820-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:40:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0802</span></div>\n<h2>AI 2027 作者：对齐下一代 AI，AI 比人省一千倍力气</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 2027 里人类对齐超级智能千难万险，agent 4 对齐下一代却几乎一次成功——Eli 承认这个不对称是真的，AI 自己动手至少省一千倍认知量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 对齐</span><span class=\"tag\">智能爆炸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jordan talks AI with Sebastian Mallaby on his show &#x27;The Spillover&#x27; open weights distillation alignment tokenomics frontier lab\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-chinatalk-美国要慢可以-但得把中国开源一起管住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94fa934f85ccd79f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>美国管制自家AI没用，除非连中国开源一起管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国若只管制自家前沿模型、不压制中国开源模型，安全逻辑不成立；真正的胜负手是算力存量和交付能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美 AI 竞争</span><span class=\"tag\">开源权重</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"270.大厂押注AI办公，飞书和钉钉却先成了配角 Agent ARR CAPEX GEO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-luanfanshu-飞书钉钉退场-ai办公的主角成了个人agent/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/490e0c935e82c209-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"乱\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">乱翻书</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>飞书钉钉退场，AI办公主角成了个人Agent</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">飞书被并入豆包、钉钉让位千问办公，企业IM历史使命终结；AI办公的核心从组织协同转向个人生产力，coding能力成为Agent底座。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI办公</span><span class=\"tag\">飞书</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E246｜何谓蒸馏？聊聊硅谷如何看中国开放模型逼近前沿 logits scaling efficiency KV cache harness Exploit Bench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-sv101-开源模型追平闭源-蒸馏指控站不住脚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>开源模型追平闭源，蒸馏指控站不住脚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">K3 与 Fable 发布只隔约 15 天，蒸馏在时间上根本来不及；真正让闭源实验室焦虑的是模型从垄断品变成流通商品，估值体系要重算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">蒸馏</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building an Autonomous Enterprise for Real-World Services with Netic Founder Melisa Tokmak roll-up essential services harness vaporware\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-31-nopriors-ai-只用来砍成本-是件很可悲的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e65a40709afebff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">34:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>AI 只用来砍成本，是件很可悲的事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Netic 创始人 Melisa Tokmak 说，私人股本见她的第一面永远先谈降本，但她真正卖的是让这些公司赚到净新增收入——她的客户已因此多赚 6 亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企业销售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Arsenic and Lace: The Trial of the Yorkshire Witch - with Maddy Pelling pleading the belly bottle conjurer ill wishes / well wishes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-31-cautionary-约克郡女巫罪案-骗局的核心是权力欲/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>女骗子死后被解剖示众：她威胁的不是钱，是秩序</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">18世纪女骗子玛丽·贝特曼以算命和毒饼行骗，不图钱财而享受掌控。她的骗术精准命中人性渴望，死后仍被解剖展示，揭示社会对秩序颠覆者的恐惧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">骗局</span><span class=\"tag\">心理操控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"149. 亲历中美neo labs资本狂潮，和清华刘子鸣聊：AI for AI、机制可解释性和Max Tegmark Physics of AI Mechanistic Interpretability Meta Model Recursive Superintelligence (RSI)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-zhangxiaojun-ai-for-ai-关键在于建立ai的物理学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba3f758130e67a9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珲·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>AI 研究的下一个突破：先给 AI 建立物理学，再让它自己发现架构</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">刘子明提出真正的AFAI不是写论文或改训练管线，而是用物理学方法先把研究结构化，再训练原模型预测训练曲线，最终让AI自己发现下一代架构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for AI</span><span class=\"tag\">机制可解释性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep 264: David Deutsch&#x27;s &quot;The Fabric of Reality&quot; Chapter 14 &quot;The Ends of the Universe&quot; Part 1 Turing-Deutsch principle mathematician&#x27;s misconception Omega Point Theory crypto inductivist\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-tokcast-知识创造者比恒星活得久-所以认识论是物理学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>知识创造者比恒星活得久，所以认识论是物理学</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把量子力学、计算、进化、认识论四条线拧成一股，结论是：只要人类不停解决问题，宇宙的长期结构将由知识而非引力决定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">认识论</span><span class=\"tag\">量子计算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is Sequence of Returns Overrated? (&amp; Other Questions) | Rational Reminder 420 Sequence of Returns Risk Sequence of Withdrawals Risk Block Bootstrap Lifecycle Model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-rationalreminder-杠杆投资理论上成立-但没人真的执行第二步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef6dd6e7563e1ad0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:51:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>杠杆投资理论上成立，但没人真的执行第二步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">论文说年轻人该按一生总财富加杠杆，但还清房贷的客户再也没借回来。序列收益风险只在取款固定时才是问题，改成可变取款，组合体操就不需要了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">杠杆投资</span><span class=\"tag\">退休规划</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Free Will: Does It Exist? Emergence Clockwork universe fMRI EEG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-sciencevs-大脑早七秒做决定-自由意志依然存在/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">31:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>脑信号早七秒出现，原作者却说自由意志还在</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李贝特与海恩斯实验显示脑信号比「你决定」早半秒到七秒，但原作者否认这等于没有自由意志；兼容论认为意志可能是微观大脑过程的宏观涌现，如同温度之于原子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自由意志</span><span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"175: 对话Liblib陈冕：关于活下来，以及所有接近死亡的时刻 PMF Reward model LTV GTM AI native ARR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-latetalk-ai-应用公司的最优解是活下来-而不是创新/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff075962598c10e7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:08:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>AI 应用公司活下来比创新更重要：Liblib 现金流转正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一家被质疑「只会抄袭+投流」的 AI 应用公司，5 月起现金流为正，付费广告收入只占 4%。创始人陈冕说：应用的时代还没来，最重要的目的是活着；第一个发现 PMF 和最终赢下市场之间，差着十万八千里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">创业生存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Earthworks spotted in the Amazon hint at huge ancient civilization LiDAR geoglyph siphuncle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-29-naturepod-亚马逊地下古文明规模是预估的十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">20:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0729</span></div>\n<h2>亚马逊雨林下藏数万土方，古文明人口或达三百万</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用 LiDAR 穿透雨林，考古学家发现亚马逊西南部藏着数万处土方工程，古文明面积超过 18 万平方公里，人口峰值或达 300 万。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亚马逊考古</span><span class=\"tag\">LiDAR</span>\n</div></div></a>"]